OL,3,GNEWSAPlanning system 'biggest hurdle'
OL,4,Afor new homes plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal planning systems are the "biggest
OL,7,Fhurdle" in delivering proposals to
OL,8,Fbuild thousands of affordable homes,
OL,9,Fsay housing associations set to receive
OL,10,Fmillions of pounds in government funds.
OL,12,FMagna Housing will receive #250m over
OL,13,F10 years to build 1,500 new homes and
OL,14,FStonewater will get #350m to create
OL,15,F2,000 homes across the country - both
OL,16,Fof which largely serve Somerset.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
