OL,3,GNEWSAPlanning system 'biggest hurdle'
OL,4,Afor new homes plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe news has been welcomed by Somerset
OL,7,FCouncil and its Liberal Democrat lead
OL,8,Ffor communities, Federica
OL,9,FSmith-Roberts, who acknowledged its
OL,10,Fplanning team continued to face
OL,11,F"challenges".
OL,13,FThe government said it was working
OL,14,Fclosely with councils like Somerset to
OL,15,F"understand where barriers may remain
OL,16,Fto council housebuilding".
